* **Broken GitHub Mailer:** Steve Lhomme noted that the automated weekly GitHub activity emails to the CELLAR mailing list have been broken since August 9, showing only commit numbers and authors without titles or links. Robert Sparks volunteered to investigate the mailer tool installation.
* **IETF 125 Planning:** Charles Eckel asked about meeting plans for IETF 125 in San Francisco. Spencer Dawkins and Steve Lhomme confirmed that the working group will not hold an in-person meeting and will continue to meet via virtual interims.

